<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>France 24 - International breaking news, top stories and headlines</title><subtitle type="html">Breaking news and world news from France 24 on Business, Sports, Culture. Video news. News from the US, Europe, Asia Pacific, Africa, Middle East, America</subtitle><id>https://www.france24.com/en/rss</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:36:14Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.france24.com/en/" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/rss" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>37 die in Nigerian custody: Reports blame overcrowding, government disputes claim</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:64228e5e2f427665bd3d70ba0ebf35213285d5c6bae2732325401133c35d5951</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:35:26Z</updated><published>2026-09-19T11:26:22Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/37-die-in-nigerian-custody-reports-blame-overcrowding-government-disputes-claim--2875a91ef8ec.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/37-die-in-nigerian-custody-reports-blame-overcrowding-government-disputes-claim" /><summary type="html">Authorities in north-central Nigeria are investigating the deaths of 37 people while they were in custody for illegal mining. Officials say the detainees died at a detention facility in Niger state, with the Nigerian Security and Civil Defence Corps pointing to a possible disease outbreak. However, some reports suggest overcrowding and poor ventilation may have contributed to the deaths. Details by FRANCE 24 correspondent Sam Olukoya.</summary></entry><entry><title>Ukrainian children learn ancient warrior skills amid modern war</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b396f765c7ed98c97a02fc1645bb625cd0cd6cb67a580a751a7c8d360810b1b3</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:35:22Z</updated><published>2026-09-19T11:21:49Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/ukrainian-children-learn-ancient-warrior-skills-amid-modern-war--fde9fce1fd13.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/ukrainian-children-learn-ancient-warrior-skills-amid-modern-war" /><summary type="html">Ukrainian children are learning the skills of 17th-century Cossack warriors – the communities that played a central role in Ukraine history, known for their military skills and horsemanship. But for these students, it is more than a history lesson. It is a chance to escape the reality of growing up during war. Story by Charlotte Lam.</summary></entry><entry><title>New France football boss Zidane names first squad</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:74f954514ec36503d6a7906bd8bc5977980adc40383a3960e7f9236ed9154023</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:35:26Z</updated><published>2026-09-19T11:20:45Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/new-france-football-boss-zidane-names-first-squad--14a06c121214.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/new-france-football-boss-zidane-names-first-squad" /><summary type="html">Football legend Zinedine Zidane says that Kylian Mbappe will be his France captain. Zidane named his first squad since being appointed head coach of France's national football team. His first matches in charge will be against Turkey and Belgium. Details by Nick Rushworth.</summary></entry><entry><title>Suspected alcohol poisoning in Nigeria's Ondo State kills at least 49 people</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:18d4412a795ea95800ecc1f78880506e51ea641cf0d2a0e3832da6d7f0888284</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:35:29Z</updated><published>2026-09-19T11:19:32Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/suspected-alcohol-poisoning-in-nigeria-s-ondo-state-kills-at-least-49-people--5aaebcf6dccb.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/suspected-alcohol-poisoning-in-nigeria-s-ondo-state-kills-at-least-49-people" /><summary type="html">In Nigeria's Ondo state, at least 49 people have died and 100 others injured after drinking alcohol suspected to contain methanol. Local authorities say 'Monkey Shoulder', a locally brewed herbal drink with high alcohol content is believed to have been the source of the poisoning, but investigations are still ongoing. State police have announced the arrest of 15 people in connection with the incident. Story by Clemence Waller.</summary></entry><entry><title>Did Trump really obtain 'permanent control' over Greenland?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b9a0b5c4c02ded054aad333a12cd8676075ada61a54c4bb1f69ca7a4baf73bd4</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:35:31Z</updated><published>2026-09-19T11:07:34Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/did-trump-really-obtain-permanent-control-over-greenland--a125835d55d1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/did-trump-really-obtain-permanent-control-over-greenland" /><summary type="html">Danish Prime Minister Mette Frederiksen has described a deal for the US to develop a significant military presence on Greenland, as 'a good agreement'. US President Donald Trump announced the deal on Friday, after he spent months seeking to acquire Greenland, citing threats from Russia and China, and even raised the possibility of military action. Story by Charlotte Hughes.</summary></entry><entry><title>Trump claims son repaid Russian oligarch who funded wedding festivities</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:57072b231a59045925b9867a18e7577f323caba71e7295c55a9898db2b4fce5d</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:35:34Z</updated><published>2026-09-19T10:26:10Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/americas/20260919-trump-says-son-repaid-russian-oligarch-who-funded-wedding-festivities--ec19dbba0a0c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20260919-trump-says-son-repaid-russian-oligarch-who-funded-wedding-festivities" /><summary type="html">US President Donald Trump said Friday that his eldest son had repaid a Kremlin-linked Russian businessman who funded two days of lavish wedding celebrations in the Bahamas, after the gift raised questions over foreign influence and ethics.</summary><category term="Americas" /></entry><entry><title>Germany cuts energy tax to lower petrol prices as Merz faces state key elections</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3647132a6c6cf2edb63464a08e3135c9458309c9eb69b94dccc9f14c044ce883</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:35:38Z</updated><published>2026-09-19T10:05:54Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/europe/20260919-germany-cuts-energy-tax-to-lower-soaring-petrol-prices--8471e3f9a878.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20260919-germany-cuts-energy-tax-to-lower-soaring-petrol-prices" /><summary type="html">Germany will cut taxes on gasoline and diesel by about 17 cents a litre from October, the government said Friday. The move comes ahead of state elections in the capital Berlin and the northeastern state of Mecklenburg-Western Pomerania where Chancellor Friedrich Merz's conservative Christian Democrats are expected to be soundly defeated.</summary><category term="Europe" /></entry><entry><title>Japan under pressure amid accommodation woes as Asian Games kick off</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:8f1759477d8b049739e78e24c0013895ba8a3afe004dc88ae656470ba8c879ce</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:35:40Z</updated><published>2026-09-19T10:02:06Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/japan-under-pressure-amid-accommodation-woes-as-asian-games-kick-off--c800f315db92.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/japan-under-pressure-amid-accommodation-woes-as-asian-games-kick-off" /><summary type="html">It’s the world's biggest sporting event, held every four years – the 20th edition of Asian games is starting in Japan. Organisers came under pressure even before competition began… as thousands more athletes and officials registered to take part than initially expected. Story by Charlotte Lam.</summary></entry><entry><title>Ebola outbreak reaches new areas in Democratic Republic of Congo</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:39890586bb03cbd3b20cfaba7aaa892a28649f26822dbc9d6874e70b1a3105d9</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:35:43Z</updated><published>2026-09-19T09:59:20Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/ebola-outbreak-reaches-new-areas-in-democratic-republic-of-congo--c0ca8e99988f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/ebola-outbreak-reaches-new-areas-in-democratic-republic-of-congo" /><summary type="html">In the Democratic Republic of Congo, the government claims that the Ebola outbreak has changed course, with cases trending downwards in hotspots. But that interpretation is being met with pushback from experts and health responders, who say the outbreak remains as bad as ever. Details by FRANCE 24 correspondent Emmet Livingstone.</summary></entry><entry><title>Spain's police launch operation to clear migrants off Ceuta beach</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4acbd54e21389e6fbc2de72e390a27159c9887794f2a90694a46c1c47dc7933f</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:35:47Z</updated><published>2026-09-19T09:57:42Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/spain-s-police-launch-operation-to-clear-migrants-off-ceuta-beach--69bde6533cca.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/spain-s-police-launch-operation-to-clear-migrants-off-ceuta-beach" /><summary type="html">Police on Friday moved hundreds of migrants from the beaches of Ceuta to a temporary camp in the Spanish enclave's port area. The police operation takes place weeks after a record influx of people into Spain's North African tiny territory. During the transfer, the police struggled to contain crowds jostling to get a place at the new tented site. The policing takes place with the issue of migration centre stage in Spain's political debate. Details by Nicholas Rushworth.</summary></entry><entry><title>France’s Macron warns of Russian ‘hybrid’ attacks, seeks to step up energy defence</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:18f75df3cbcd5a926068cb7bd41c39a56fa3332456cf9ab693da387af1cf05f8</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:35:49Z</updated><published>2026-09-19T09:52:53Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/france-s-macron-warns-of-russian-hybrid-attacks-seeks-to-step-up-energy-defence--04c7e0a32971.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/france-s-macron-warns-of-russian-hybrid-attacks-seeks-to-step-up-energy-defence" /><summary type="html">Just months before France's presidential election, rising fuel costs due to the wars in Iran and Ukraine have pushed the nation to the verge of crisis. In an attempt to address public anger and energy threats, French President Emmanuel Macron gathered the nation's major party presidential candidates at the presidential palace. But the main takeaway from this meeting was perhaps Macron's warning about Russian "hybrid attacks"... what exactly does he mean and how serious is the threat? Details and analysis by Richard Werly, France and Europe correspondent for Blick.</summary></entry><entry><title>More than 112,000 displaced in Yemen as Houthis seize more ground</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:980225fadbf8a11467a28cbebaed4ab781b9fd7505277aa4e62244237b29b46e</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:35:53Z</updated><published>2026-09-19T08:57:59Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/more-than-112-000-displaced-in-yemen-as-houthis-seize-more-ground--fdb60ca50a35.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/more-than-112-000-displaced-in-yemen-as-houthis-seize-more-ground" /><summary type="html">Pro-Houthi demonstrations erupted in Yemen after Saudi Arabia accused the military group of targeting the Muslim holy site of Mecca. Story by Elitsa Gadeva.</summary></entry><entry><title>Princess Diana's iconic 'revenge dress' goes to auction</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:23f9c8dd91e20aaf827a05098b80871713a128df14e00c66f0d4350fa89fb285</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:35:56Z</updated><published>2026-09-19T08:57:38Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/princess-diana-s-iconic-revenge-dress-goes-to-auction--d035f6b47dc6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/princess-diana-s-iconic-revenge-dress-goes-to-auction" /><summary type="html">As the worldwide release of Diana Spencer’s brother’s book prompts a reaction from King Charles and the British Crown, another piece of Diana's legacy is making headlines – the iconic little black dress, worn by the then Princess of Wales, is going under the hammer. Better known as the "Revenge Dress", it would go on to inspire generations of women.</summary></entry><entry><title>Donald Trump bans three media outlets from the White House, accusing them of spreading 'fake news'</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c4dcdb61281068dd57655a96d4a99266b39b7487f76a0d15fa7f5fe5978bf8aa</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:35:59Z</updated><published>2026-09-19T08:53:42Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/donald-trump-bans-three-media-outlets-from-the-white-house-accusing-them-of-spreading-fake-news--728977f11446.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/donald-trump-bans-three-media-outlets-from-the-white-house-accusing-them-of-spreading-fake-news" /><summary type="html">Donald Trump announced Friday he is banning CNN, MS NOW and Politico from the White House, accusing all three outlets of spreading 'fake news'. The move is almost certain to face legal challenges, and has been denounced by press freedom advocates. The US president's relationship with media outlets has long been fraught, as Charlotte Hughes explains.</summary></entry><entry><title>US and Denmark reach deal on Greenland, Trump claims 'permanent control' over island</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:683ed2fc5f385b77cd818b816fbef39d332d24c34421a3b31d60ae063da33e46</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:36:01Z</updated><published>2026-09-19T08:48:55Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/us-and-denmark-reach-deal-on-greenland-trump-claims-permanent-control-over-island--23916a8df746.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/us-and-denmark-reach-deal-on-greenland-trump-claims-permanent-control-over-island" /><summary type="html">Not so long ago, inhabitants of Greenland feared that the US was preparing to invade, after US President Donald Trump repeatedly claimed the US wanted to control the Arctic territory. But Trump now says he has struck a deal with Denmark to give Washington "permanent control" over Greenland's security, while ensuring the territory remains firmly in the hands of Denmark. Denmark and Greenland have both hailed the deal, but its exact terms remain unclear. Details by FRANCE 24 correspondent in Washington, Fraser Jackson.</summary></entry><entry><title>Scientists discover first new wild cat in more than 100 years</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ec113dd5f672e4fab04a8b14df539e6847b4d201538fe201091709ddc5ab8af1</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:36:05Z</updated><published>2026-09-19T08:44:23Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/americas/20260919-scientists-discover-first-new-wild-cat-in-more-than-100-years--a1fa381b5177.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20260919-scientists-discover-first-new-wild-cat-in-more-than-100-years" /><summary type="html">Scientists have identified a previously unknown species of wild cat living at a wildlife sanctuary in Bolivia. The tiny, spotted feline had lived at the sanctuary for years before genetic analysis revealed it as the first new living wild cat species identified in more than a century.</summary><category term="Americas" /></entry><entry><title>France: Zinédine Zidane brings a breath of fresh air to Les Bleus</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:6ca90713f0f62008f20377e94b3c5ac3c9a8da969c634b5ed10509b1f06e2c71</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:36:12Z</updated><published>2026-09-19T08:10:38Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/sports/20260919-france-zin_dine-zidane-brings-a-breath-of-fresh-air-to-les-bleus--1dffedac6764.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/sports/20260919-france-zin%C3%A9dine-zidane-brings-a-breath-of-fresh-air-to-les-bleus" /><summary type="html">For his first squad announcement on Friday, new France boss Zinédine Zidane made it clear he intends to break with Didier Deschamps. Five new faces, an attacking philosophy ... Ahead of his first games in charge in the Nations League, “ZZ” is bringing a breath of fresh air to Les Bleus.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>Cuba hit with another nationwide blackout amid US fuel blockade</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:46a6a452ca36519ea193ba55bb19b8a26c52160b601d25cccf1e46182048fcee</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:36:10Z</updated><published>2026-09-19T06:31:52Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/americas/20260919-cuba-s-power-grid-collapses-again-leaving-island-in-darkness--27a189638edf.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20260919-cuba-s-power-grid-collapses-again-leaving-island-in-darkness" /><summary type="html">Cuba suffered a total blackout after the collapse of its electrical grid on Friday. The blackout is the latest of at least six partial or total grid collapses since the beginning of this year, as the island grapples with an ongoing US fuel blockade.</summary><category term="Americas" /></entry><entry><title>Live: Russia reports cyberattacks as parliamentary vote enters second day</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:298be9dc8b23d176321e99600965e086794816e0c3af296481fb1b9bab6f46e4</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:36:14Z</updated><published>2026-09-19T05:24:28Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/europe/20260919-ukraine-live-russian-strike-on-apartment-building-in-ukraine-s-sumy-kills-at-least-two--a8179e07ef68.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20260919-ukraine-live-russian-strike-on-apartment-building-in-ukraine-s-sumy-kills-at-least-two" /><summary type="html">Russia said Saturday that its electronic voting system in Moscow had come under “powerful” cyberattacks overnight, as parliamentary elections entered their second day. Russian President Vladimir Putin on Friday accused Ukraine of seeking to “hinder” the vote, a claim Kyiv has not publicly addressed. Follow our liveblog for all the latest updates.</summary><category term="Europe" /></entry><entry><title>Trump says US, Denmark reach deal to expand military presence in Greenland</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:736684508b71b10353f55e75d4146d4d5e5fd9d87b0e3709f4eb533dc003a010</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:34:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-18T22:18:14Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/europe/20260918-greenland-denmark-us-deal-un-general-assembly--57e97d7b07ab.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20260918-greenland-denmark-us-deal-un-general-assembly" /><summary type="html">US President Donald Trump said on Friday he had reached a deal with Denmark to expand the US military presence in Greenland, while respecting Danish and Greenlandic sovereignty. Denmark said the agreement would be signed next week during the UN General Assembly but still requires parliamentary approval.</summary><category term="Europe" /></entry><entry><title>🔴 Greenland, Denmark say they expect to sign deal with the US on the sidelines of UN General Assembly</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:0d83f93b6dcfb3545af4d3a348a86294d7cf77a607393ee2cfa79c74cb7548bd</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:34:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-18T21:59:51Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/europe/20260918-greenland-denmark-us-deal-un-general-assembly--57e97d7b07ab.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20260918-greenland-denmark-us-deal-un-general-assembly" /></entry><entry><title>Uproar in Niger state, 37 die in custody</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b43e08e3cc7d0043ce3fb03b8ec9e1020f28ca36d5b2227941a8cdc3769bf32f</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:34:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-18T20:52:51Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/uproar-in-niger-state-37-die-in-custody--9b3070eb9dd2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/uproar-in-niger-state-37-die-in-custody" /><summary type="html">In tonights programme, investigation is ongoing into the death in custody of thirty-seven people, accused of illegal mining in Nigeria. Also,Tunisia is emerging as a major boat-building hub, serving both local buyers and international markets. And finally, we speak to the author of “The Moon Will Not Burn Us”, Ricci Shryock.</summary><category term="Eye on Africa" /></entry><entry><title>UEFA, CONCACAF demand FIFA make $2.1 billion payout to member groups amid funding row</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:2b93e285f4bcbd7773a7eef79def76d3145b2f6359e9f0976a2eb790ccdf5259</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:34:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-18T19:45:30Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/sport/20260918-uefa-concacaf-demand-fifa-make-2-1-billion-payout-to-member-groups-amid-funding-row--8853be8265b7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/sport/20260918-uefa-concacaf-demand-fifa-make-2-1-billion-payout-to-member-groups-amid-funding-row" /><summary type="html">UEFA and CONCACAF chiefs have urged FIFA President Gianni Infantino to release around $2.1 billion from the governing body's reserves, calling for each of its 211 member associations to receive $10 million over the 2027-30 cycle. The demand comes amid tensions over Infantino's proposed sale of a stake in the World Cup to private investors, which was shelved after a backlash from European football.</summary><category term="Sport" /></entry><entry><title>Trump bans media outlets CNN, MSNOW, Politico from White House</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:46be75566e4ad78dab641a98c1a47404cccb957b4159b212e20e2f96839bc1c4</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:34:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-18T19:23:52Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/live-news/20260918-trump-bans-media-outlets-cnn-msnow-politico-from-white-house--c1cb3f86658d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/live-news/20260918-trump-bans-media-outlets-cnn-msnow-politico-from-white-house" /></entry></feed>
